IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. STATUS-TWO-READ-02.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
SELECT INFILE ASSIGN TO "input.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS IN-STATUS.
SELECT OUTFILE ASSIGN TO "output.dat" ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL FILE STATUS IS OUT-STATUS.
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD INFILE.
01 IN-REC.
05 PAYLOAD PIC X(5) VALUE "UNSET".
FD OUTFILE.
01 OUT-REC.
05 OUT-TEXT PIC X(2).
05 OUT-ORDER PIC 9(1).
05 OUT-MARK PIC X(1) VALUE "R".
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01 OUT-STATUS PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01 READ-COUNT PIC 9(1) VALUE 0.
01 VARIANT-TAG PIC X(1) VALUE "B".
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
OPEN INPUT INFILE
OPEN OUTPUT OUTFILE
READ INFILE AT END
    MOVE "F" TO OUT-MARK
END-READ
IF IN-STATUS = "00"
    ADD 1 TO READ-COUNT END-ADD
    PERFORM EMIT-ROW
END-IF
READ INFILE AT END
    MOVE "E" TO OUT-MARK
END-READ
IF IN-STATUS = "00"
    ADD 1 TO READ-COUNT END-ADD
    IF READ-COUNT >= 2
        PERFORM EMIT-ROW
    END-IF
END-IF
DISPLAY IN-STATUS "/" OUT-STATUS
CLOSE INFILE
CLOSE OUTFILE
STOP RUN.
EMIT-ROW.
MOVE PAYLOAD TO OUT-TEXT
MOVE READ-COUNT TO OUT-ORDER
MOVE VARIANT-TAG TO OUT-MARK
WRITE OUT-REC
.
